==Strategies==
The main problem of the stage is the Henry and Gory Dark combo, usually destroying any cats caught in Henry's freeze. Freeze-immune cats work nicely here, but be careful as Zang Roo can burrow through and destroy your back lines. If you can manage to sneak [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] into Henry's blind spot at the start of the level (with a few tanky ubers for the Gorys), this stage can be considered already won.

